@project-remix-updates The 2024 Weapons Pack Vol. 1 + 2 Bonus Maps Update

happy saturday!
originally this was going to be the weapons pack update with 6 new weapons but with recent events i've been a little discouraged and stressed so i'm releasing this half-update for now and i might extend my break a little but enjoy the 2 bonus maps i wanted to include :)

@project-remix-updates happy 2026! here's our development roadmap for the coming months ^.^
we decided that the upcoming updates are pretty large and letting the community know what's going to happen so that we don't have unexplained development time between updates & also give something to look forward to!


(these are only plans for major updates and do not include minor patches & balancing adjustment plans)
